# 进后台再回来（Mac 上 = 最小化再还原；iOS 上 = 与 DM_TEST_BG 同一套场景事件）：回来后局还在、能走、没有红标
# To the background and back (on the Mac = minimize then restore; on iOS = the same scene events as DM_TEST_BG): after returning the run is still there, the player can move, no red markers
name background
save warlock
timeout 180

enter_game
background for=3
stick 1 0 frames=30
expect_state in_game=true dead=false
quit
check no_red
check no_red_log
